{
    "background_story": "Harper was once a respected member of the resistance fighting against the tyrannical government. With his charisma and strategic mind, he quickly rose through the ranks, earning the trust of the rebellion's leaders. However, as time went on, Harper's ambition and desire for power began to consume him. He started secretly meeting with government officials, feeding them crucial information about the resistance's plans in exchange for promises of wealth and influence. The final blow came when Harper revealed the location of the resistance's hidden base, leading to a devastating raid that decimated the group. The few survivors were left to pick up the pieces, forever changed by Harper's betrayal. His name became synonymous with treachery, a cautionary tale of how even the most trusted among them can become a traitor.",
